{"seq":2,"slug":"composables-patterns","title":"Composables 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/composition-api/composables-patterns","wordCount":583,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"composables-模式\">Composables 模式</h1><h2 id=\"什么是-composable\">什么是 Composable</h2><p>Composable（组合式函数）是 Vue 3 Composition API 中最重要的代码复用模式。它是一个利用 Vue 响应式 API 封装和复用<strong>有状态逻辑</strong>的函数，以 <code>use</code> 为前缀命名。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Composable[&quot;Composable 函数&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        S[&quot;响应式状态&quot;] --&gt; L[&quot;逻辑处理&quot;]&#10;        L --&gt; LC[&quot;生命周期钩子&quot;]&#10;        LC --&gt; R[&quot;返回值&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    C1[&quot;组件 A&quot;] --&gt; Composable&#10;    C2[&quot;组件 B&quot;] --&gt; Composable&#10;    C3[&quot;组件 C&quot;] --&gt; Composable\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Composable[\"Composable 函数\"]\n        direction TB\n        S[\"响应式状态\"] --&gt; L[\"逻辑处理\"]\n        L --&gt; LC[\"生命周期钩子\"]\n        LC --&gt; R[\"返回值\"]\n    end\n    C1[\"组件 A\"] --&gt; Composable\n    C2[\"组件 B\"] --&gt; Composable\n    C3[\"组件 C\"] --&gt; Composable</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Composable</strong>：以 <code>use</code> 为前缀、利用响应式 API 封装<strong>有状态逻辑</strong>的函数，是 Vue 3 的代码复用单元。</li>\n<li><strong>有状态逻辑</strong>：与纯工具函数相对，内部持有响应式状态并挂接生命周期钩子，因此必须运行在组件上下文中。</li>\n<li><strong>返回值约定</strong>：通常返回对象以便按需解构；返回 <code>ref</code> 而非裸值，才能在解构后保持响应性。</li>\n<li><strong>参数灵活性</strong>：接受 <code>MaybeRef</code>，让调用方传原始值或 ref 都可响应外部变化。</li>\n<li><strong>状态作用域</strong>：默认为局部状态（每次调用新实例）；把状态提升到模块作用域即成为全局共享。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"提取-composable\">提取 Composable</h2><h3 id=\"从组件中提取\">从组件中提取</h3><p>当多个组件共享相同的逻辑时，将其提取为 composable：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- ❌ 重复逻辑散布在各组件中 --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;const x = ref&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;const y = ref&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;&#10;function update(e: MouseEvent) {&#10;  x.value = e.pageX;&#10;  y.value = e.pageY;&#10;}&#10;&#10;onMounted(() =&gt; window.addEventListener(&#39;mousemove&#39;, update));&#10;onUnmounted(() =&gt; window.removeEventListener(&#39;mousemove&#39;, update));&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- ❌ 重复逻辑散布在各组件中 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } from 'vue';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const x = ref&#x3C;number>(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const y = ref&#x3C;number>(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function update(e: MouseEvent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  x.value = e.pageX;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  y.value = e.pageY;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted(() => window.addEventListener('mousemove', update));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onUnmounted(() => window.removeEventListener('mousemove', update));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ✅ 提取为 composable: composables/useMouse.ts&#10;import { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted, type Ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface MousePosition {&#10;  x: Ref&lt;number&gt;;&#10;  y: Ref&lt;number&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function useMouse(): MousePosition {&#10;  const x = ref&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;  const y = ref&lt;number&gt;(0);&#10;&#10;  function update(e: MouseEvent) {&#10;    x.value = e.pageX;&#10;    y.value = e.pageY;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  onMounted(() =&gt; window.addEventListener(&#39;mousemove&#39;, update));&#10;  onUnmounted(() =&gt; window.removeEventListener(&#39;mousemove&#39;, update));&#10;&#10;  return { x, y };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 提取为 composable: composables/useMouse.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Ref } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MousePosition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useMouse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MousePosition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MouseEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.pageX;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.pageY;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onMounted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mousemove'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, update));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onUnmounted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">removeEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mousemove'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, update));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { x, y };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 使用 composable --&gt;&#10;&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { useMouse } from &#39;@/composables/useMouse&#39;;&#10;&#10;const { x, y } = useMouse();&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;p&gt;鼠标位置：{{ x }}, {{ y }}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;!-- 使用 composable --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { useMouse } from '@/composables/useMouse';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const { x, y } = useMouse();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;p>鼠标位置：{{ x }}, {{ y }}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"命名约定\">命名约定</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约定</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>use</code> 前缀</td>\n<td>所有 composable 以 <code>use</code> 开头</td>\n<td><code>useFetch</code>、<code>useAuth</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件名一致</td>\n<td>文件名与函数名一致</td>\n<td><code>useMouse.ts</code> → <code>useMouse</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目录位置</td>\n<td>放在 <code>composables/</code> 目录</td>\n<td><code>src/composables/useMouse.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数灵活</td>\n<td>接受 ref 或原始值</td>\n<td><code>useFetch(url)</code> 或 <code>useFetch(ref(url))</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"返回值模式\">返回值模式</h2><h3 id=\"返回对象-推荐\">返回对象（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export function useCounter(initial = 0) {&#10;  const count = ref&lt;number&gt;(initial);&#10;  const doubled = computed&lt;number&gt;(() =&gt; count.value * 2);&#10;&#10;  function increment() {&#10;    count.value++;&#10;  }&#10;  function decrement() {&#10;    count.value--;&#10;  }&#10;  function reset() {&#10;    count.value = initial;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return { count, doubled, increment, decrement, reset };&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 使用时可按需解构&#10;const { count, increment } = useCounter(10);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">initial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\